<!doctype html>
<html lang="{{ meta.mainLanguage }}">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0b1220" />
    <meta name="description" content="One-page intro to Mr. Phil, Technology Teacher at DaVinci Academy." />
    <title>About Mr. Phil — The Technology Teacher</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/about-mr-phil.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/custom-style.css" />
  </head>
  <body class="amp-body">
    <div class="amp-page">
    {% if breadcrumbs and breadcrumbs.length > 0 %}
      <div class="breadcrumbs--standalone">{% include "components/breadcrumbs.njk" %}</div>
    {% endif %}
    <article class="amp-sheet" aria-label="About Mr. Phil">
      <header class="amp-head">
        <div class="amp-head-top">
          <span class="amp-badge">DaVinci Tech · Short edition</span>
        </div>
        {% set version = 'short' %}
        {% include "about-mr-phil/version-nav.njk" %}
        <div class="amp-head-row">
          <div class="amp-head-text">
            <h1>Mr. Phil</h1>
            <p class="amp-tagline">Your Technology teacher. Code. Games. Video. Media arts.</p>
          </div>
          <figure class="amp-portrait">
            <img src="/img/user/Pictures/CARROLL.png" width="96" height="96" alt="Mr. Phil" loading="eager" decoding="async" />
          </figure>
        </div>
      </header>

      {% include "about-mr-phil/stats.njk" %}

      <div class="amp-grid">
        <section class="amp-panel amp-panel--hero">
          <h2>👋 Hey — you belong here.</h2>
          <p>
            I'm <strong>Mr. Phil</strong>. I teach Tech at DaVinci Academy.
            You matter. This room is safe to ask questions, get stuff wrong, and try again.
          </p>
          <p class="amp-mini">
            You already bring cool ideas to class. My job? Give you chances to learn — from me,
            from friends, and from the work. I live with Jilly, two dogs, and a cat.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="amp-panel">
          <h2>⚡ Mr. Phil's 4 Rules</h2>
          <ol class="amp-rules">
            <li><strong>We build.</strong> You do the work. I guide.</li>
            <li><strong>Mistakes = clues.</strong> Not game over.</li>
            <li><strong>Ball = mic.</strong> Whoever holds the D20 talks. We listen.</li>
            <li><strong>Don't be a Gort.</strong> Ask why. Think for yourself.</li>
          </ol>
        </section>

        <section class="amp-panel">
          <h2>🎮 Class vibes</h2>
          <ul class="amp-chips">
            <li>Hands-on projects</li>
            <li>Code &amp; debug</li>
            <li>Game design</li>
            <li>Video &amp; media</li>
            <li>Free Choice time</li>
            <li>D&amp;D club</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="amp-mini">
            Done with the main task? <strong>Free Choice time</strong> — read, play, catch up,
            or keep building. Freedom <em>and</em> choice. Trust, not chaos.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="amp-panel amp-panel--words">
          <h2>📚 Word Power <span class="amp-sub">(fancy words, plain English)</span></h2>
          <dl class="amp-words">
            <div>
              <dt>Abstraction</dt>
              <dd>Keep the main idea. Drop what doesn't matter. (Stick figure = person. Computer = 1s and 0s.)</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Agency</dt>
              <dd>You get real choices — not just "do what I say."</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Iterate</dt>
              <dd>Try → fix → try again. That's how pros do it.</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </section>
      </div>

      {% include "about-mr-phil/gallery.njk" %}

      <footer class="amp-sign">
        <p class="amp-quote">"I want you to see me as a teammate in your joy — not a brick in the wall."</p>
        <p class="amp-outro">Show up. Take a risk. Ask for help. Let's build something awesome.</p>
        <p class="amp-sig">— Mr. Phil</p>
      </footer>
    </article>
    </div>
    <script src="/scripts/about-mr-phil.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
